translate chinese liu_button_bedroom_book_71163651:

    # liu f_worried "Of course, the baker refuses and mocks the stranger... \"What could a wretch like you have to offer a man such as me?\""
    liu f_worried "面包师当然拒绝了，还嘲笑那陌生人……“你这种穷鬼能给我这样的人什么？”"

# lib/windows-i686/scripts/characters/liu/dialogue/bedroom.rpyc:94
