    liu @ -m_talk "嗯哼。"

# lib/windows-i686/scripts/characters/liu/dialogue/bedroom.rpyc:97
translate chinese liu_button_bedroom_book_0449ef88:

    # liu "The stranger said, \"Indeed, I have nothing that could equal the value of your delicious sweet buns recipe...\""
    liu "陌生人说：“确实，我没有什么能比得上你那美味甜包子秘方的价值……”"

# lib/windows-i686/scripts/characters/liu/dialogue/bedroom.rpyc:98
translate chinese liu_button_bedroom_book_132b8d22:

    # liu f_happy "But he knew the baker's greed was great, and so he offered him a wager instead."
    liu f_happy "但他知道面包师贪得无厌，于是改提了个赌约。"

